{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>Carry your brothers from before the sanctuary.</b> Some say the incense was before the altar of burnt offering, and the Levites enter there. And some say it was on the altar of incense, and Moses brought them out from the Tent of Meeting." "<b>Before the sanctuary.</b> It is the courtyard, opposite the camp, as I explained."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 10, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:09:15.205061832Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}